   {
    "text": "A spacious 4-room home offering city-fringe convenience with easy access to the CBD and Sentosa, plus a strong resale and rental track record.\n\nLocation\nTucked along Telok Blangah Street 31, minutes from HarbourFront, VivoCity, and the Alexandra/Mapletree business corridor — one MRT stop from Sentosa and a short ride into the CBD via Circle Line/NEL. Connectivity improves further once the Circle Line loop closes (Keppel, Cantonment, Prince Edward Road).\n\nGetting Around\nTelok Blangah MRT (CC28) — approx. 550–600m, 7–10 min walk\nHarbourFront Interchange (CC29/NE1) — 1 stop away, linking to the North East Line and Sentosa Express\n7-min drive (or ~15–20 min bus) to VivoCity / HarbourFront Centre\n\nShops & Malls\nVivoCity — one of Singapore's largest malls, 1 MRT stop or short drive away\nTelok Blangah Market & Food Centre, plus nearby hawker centres (Telok Blangah Crescent Market, Alexandra Village Food Centre)\n\nSchools\nBlangah Rise Primary School — within 1km\nGan Eng Seng Primary School — within 1–2km\nRadin Mas Primary School — within 1–2km\n\nParks & Recreation\nTelok Blangah Hill Park and Mount Faber Park, linked by Henderson Waves, Singapore's highest pedestrian bridge\nHortPark and Labrador Nature Reserve nearby\nPart of the Southern Ridges park connector network\nClose proximity to Sentosa for weekend leisure\n\nOther Highlights\nHealthcare: Alexandra Hospital and Singapore General Hospital under a 10-min drive\nWorkplace convenience: close to Mapletree Business City and Alexandra Technopark\n\nDisclaimer\nWhile every effort has been made to ensure accuracy, all details are subject to change and should be independently verified. The agent and agency accept no liability for any errors, omissions, or reliance placed on this listing.",
